  "title": "wslua_gcrypt: Fix some casts",
  "description": "A lua_Integer is probably 64-bit, so when casting between a lua_Integer\nand a size_t, don't go through 32-bit integers as that might shorten\nthe value.\n\nAlso, fix an erroneous check where err has already been checked.\n(Coverity CID 1644563)",
